    <briefdescription>
<para>HORUS BT leaves that act on the system rather than on the robot: </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>&lt;EmergencyStop reason=&quot;pain reported&quot;&gt; supervisor -&gt; EMERGENCY_STOP (always SUCCESS) &lt;StartRecording&gt; &lt;StopRecording&gt; open / close a trial on /horus/session &lt;AddTrialNote text=&quot;rest 60 s&quot;&gt; note in the running trial &lt;SetSpeedScale value=&quot;0.8&quot;&gt; live speed of every generator behavior</para>
<para>Service leaves call on a private callback group drained on every tick (container-agnostic, like the other leaves) and fail after <computeroutput>timeout</computeroutput> s without a reply. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
